61","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-13","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001626878","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1626878/000117184326001561/xbit20251231_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c5ef7a3bc0ea04e446a4b5bd26540f788700403369c717f23819efc14ceb7ac1.bin","sha256":"c5ef7a3bc0ea04e446a4b5bd26540f788700403369c717f23819efc14ceb7ac1"}},{"id":"f762a081f1923c36bf73f2a81138675a2c713a5ddf29ed6acfc74dadac83a845","quote":"Product candidates we advance into clinical trials may not have favorable results in clinical trials or receive regulatory approval. We have experienced prior setbacks and unfavorable outcomes in clinical trials and previously announced a pause in our rheumatology program in December 2024 following irregularities at clinical sites. We cannot assure that future clinical outcomes will be favorable.","context":"●","section":"RISK FACTORS","block":147,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001171843-26-001561","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-13","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001626878","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1626878/000117184326001561/xbit20251231_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c5ef7a3bc0ea04e446a4b5bd26540f788700403369c717f23819efc14ceb7ac1.bin","sha256":"c5ef7a3bc0ea04e446a4b5bd26540f788700403369c717f23819efc14ceb7ac1"}},{"id":"816ea9b1aac34570a01ef374d0f45f43d565c361c186170829539b3b97d2dc85","quote":"For various reasons, we may be unable to complete clinical trials on a timely basis, incurring higher costs and delayed development timelines.","context":"●","section":"RISK FACTORS","block":149,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001171843-26-001561","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-13","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001626878","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1626878/000117184326001561/xbit20251231_10k.htm","rawPath":"