s, and our expenses may be higher than expected. Raising funds in the future may present additional challenges and future financing may not be available in sufficient amounts or on terms acceptable to us, if at all.","context":"the costs involved in preparing, filing, prosecuting, maintaining, defending and enforcing patents, including litigation costs and the outcome of any such litigation.","section":"RISK FACTORS","block":222,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001171843-26-001561","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-13","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001626878","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1626878/000117184326001561/xbit20251231_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c5ef7a3bc0ea04e446a4b5bd26540f788700403369c717f23819efc14ceb7ac1.bin","sha256":"c5ef7a3bc0ea04e446a4b5bd26540f788700403369c717f23819efc14ceb7ac1"}},{"id":"e9bef40f846e91bd19ca5d9e51a26544d2c012abfe56130b18615d3962811aef","quote":"We currently have no source of product revenue and may never sustain profitability.","context":"We are unable to accurately estimate the funds we will actually require to complete research and development of our product candidates or the funds required to commercialize any resulting product in the future or the funds that will be required to meet other expenses. Our operating plan may change as a result of many factors currently unknown to us, and our expenses may be higher than expected. Raising funds in the future may present additional challenges and future financing may not be available in sufficient amounts or on terms acceptable to us, if at all.","section":"RISK FACTORS","block":223,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001171843-26-001561","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-13","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001626878","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/162687